bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Help the customers by listening to their descriptions carefully and figure out what their problem is!





Possible problems include Malware, Bloatware, and System Failure.

Once you guess correctly, you will play a minigame corresponding to the type of problem.

Beware! Mistakes will reduce your payment at the end of the day, and  if you mess up enough, the customer will leave."

