[node name="Diagnosis" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MarginContainer2" unique_id=1403026550]
visible = false
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(1, 0.76862746, 0.5568628, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_k0a60")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Ask the customer questions and deduct whether the problem is Malware, Bloatware, or System Failure.

Each problem has the following characteristics:

Malware: Usually will use substantial power and cause overheating or crashes. Downloaded and initiated by an user who are being deceived or clueless.

Bloatware: Sluggish performance or storage specific issues. Will usually have a clear indicator for those who know where to look.

System Failure: Crashes and poor perfomance, Caused by system modifications or bad updates."

[node name="Malware" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MarginContainer2" unique_id=955521290]
visible = false
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/default_color = Color(1, 0.76862746, 0.5568628, 1)
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_k0a60")
text = "Minigame - Malware

Find and remove all the malware to clear the minigame! Click the icon directly to remove a file.

How to find Malware:
Malware files has jittery movements.







You can use the Magnifier (    this thing) to immediately \"reveal\" all the malware temporarily if you're struggling.

Revealed malware looks like this ->"

